OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle detained
OL,4,Afor allegedly cutting off ankle
OL,5,Amonitor, officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, has been detained in
OL,9,FFlorida for allegedly removing his
OL,10,Fankle monitor, according to justice
OL,11,Fdepartment officials in Los Angeles.
OL,13,FMarkle appeared before a federal
OL,14,Fmagistrate judge in the Florida city of
OL,15,FTampa after allegedly removing the
OL,16,Fmonitor at 01:45 local time (06:45
OL,17,FGMT), a justice department (DoJ)
OL,18,Fspokesperson told the BBC.
OL,20,FThe judge ordered him jailed without
OL,21,Fbond and he is now in federal custody,
OL,22,Fthe spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
