OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle detained
OL,4,Afor allegedly cutting off ankle
OL,5,Amonitor, officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarkle, who has previously denied
OL,8,Fpossessing images of child sex abuse,
OL,9,Fwas arrested in Florida last week and
OL,10,Fplaced under house detention. He was
OL,11,Falso ordered to wear a location
OL,12,Fmonitoring device.
